# Ephara's Dispersal under Thalia, Guardian of Thraben: the total cost is the mana cost plus every increase minus every
# reduction (CR 601.2f), and a reduction of generic mana only takes generic (CR 118.7a). {2}{U} plus Thalia's {1} is
# {3}{U}; at the attacking Thalia it is {2} less, {1}{U}, paid exactly by Bot2's two Islands (the pool is empty right
# after: a reduction of {3} would leave {U} floating). At Bot1's Ornithopter, which stayed home, {3}{U} is short.

